---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="DMCA and Copyright Policy - TDEE Check"
  description="TDEE Check copyright and DMCA policy: how to report copyright infringement, what a valid takedown notice needs, and how counter notices work."
  path="/dmca/"
  crumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'DMCA Policy', path: '/dmca/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-10">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink-900">DMCA and copyright policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Our content</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      The text, calculators, and illustrations on TDEE Check are original work created for this site, built on published
      scientific formulas that are not themselves copyrightable. We respect the intellectual property rights of others
      and expect others to respect ours.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Reporting infringement</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      If you believe that material on this site infringes your copyright, send a written notice to
      <strong>contact [at] tdeecheck.com</strong> with the subject line "DMCA notice". A valid notice under the Digital
      Millennium Copyright Act (17 U.S.C. 512) includes:
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-6">
      <li>Your full name, address, telephone number, and email address</li>
      <li>Identification of the copyrighted work you claim has been infringed</li>
      <li>The exact URL of the material on this site that you claim is infringing</li>
      <li>A statement that you have a good faith belief that the use is not authorized by the copyright owner, its agent, or the law</li>
      <li>A statement, under penalty of perjury, that the information in your notice is accurate and that you are the copyright owner or authorized to act on their behalf</li>
      <li>Your physical or electronic signature</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">What happens next</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      Valid notices are reviewed promptly, and material found to infringe is removed or disabled. The person who posted
      or provided the material, where applicable, is informed and may submit a counter notice with their contact details,
      identification of the removed material, and a statement under penalty of perjury that the removal was a mistake or
      misidentification. If a counter notice is received, the material may be restored 10 to 14 business days later
      unless the original reporter files court action.
    </p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-extrabold text-ink-900">Repeat infringers</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700 leading-relaxed">
      Accounts and contributors who repeatedly infringe copyright will be permanently removed from the site. Questions
      about this policy can be sent through our <a class="font-bold text-brand-700 underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
